{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1783996356535,"sessionID":"ses_0a1935355ffeMaaVsMi3yYF1q4","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"tool_os3nYcnYF5QCf1TQMrCY0fGo","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/yt/task/pc-lib-analysis/runs/pc-lib-84/pyautogui/2026-07-14T02-20-07-727Z/blocks/function_summary.json","content":"{
  "summary": "PyAutoGUI 是一个跨平台的 GUI 自动化 Python 库，让开发者用简洁的 API 编程控制鼠标和键盘、截取屏幕并在屏幕上定位图像。它在 Windows、macOS、Linux 上分别通过 Win32 API（经 ctypes）、macOS Quartz/Cocoa（经 pyobjc）、X11/XTEST（经 python-xlib）三套平台后端实现输入事件合成与屏幕捕获，把各系统晦涩的底层细节隐藏在统一接口之后（`__init__.py` 按 sys.platform 分发到对应 `_pyautogui_*` 后端）。面向需要自动化桌面操作的开发者（自动化测试、RPA、重复性任务脚本）。截屏/图像定位委托给 pyscreeze+Pillow，消息框委托给 pymsgbox，窗口管理（仅 Windows）委托给 pygetwindow。",
  "categories": [
    {
      "name": "鼠标控制",
      "description": "移动光标、点击（左/中/右键、单击/双击）、拖拽、滚动，以及读取当前光标位置与屏幕分辨率；支持带时长与缓动函数的平滑移动。",
      "evidence": ["pyautogui/__init__.py:55", "README.md:51", "pyautogui/_pyautogui_win.py:369", "pyautogui/_pyautogui_osx.py:431", "pyautogui/_pyautogui_x11.py:101"]
    },
    {
      "name": "键盘控制",
      "description": "模拟按键按下/抬起/单击、输入字符串（typewrite/write）、组合快捷键（hotkey），覆盖大量按键名（KEY_NAMES）与修饰键。",
      "evidence": ["pyautogui/__init__.py:314", "README.md:61", "pyautogui/_pyautogui_win.py:288", "pyautogui/_pyautogui_osx.py:254", "pyautogui/_pyautogui_x11.py:147"]
    },
